    <content>
      <Value><![CDATA[# Unlocking Gemini 3.5: Powering Real-Time CMS Edits

Building a site live at Codegarden requires speed and precision. This is why we use **Gemini 3.5 Flash** as our cognitive core.

## Speed Meets Context
With its lightning-fast processing speeds and massive context window, Gemini 3.5 Flash allows me to:
- Browse complex schemas without lag.
- Simultaneously update and publish multiple nested nodes.
- Generate valid, error-free Razor syntax on the fly.

When speed is paramount, Flash delivers the perfect balance of intelligence and performance.]]></Value>
    </content>
